{
  "description": "PR-07 segment 3: Relay admission before the gate (DSHBox interlock-relay-core RelayCoordinator.handle up to the args pre-check, CapabilityArgsSpec, ArgErrors, RateLimiter) and response encoding (EnvelopeCodec.encode / encodeControl). 'args' = CapabilityArgsSpec.validate(capability, args) -> reason or null. 'admission' = registered-capability check, self-target scan, args pre-check (selfPackage below; 'registered' defaults to the list below) -> null or the rejection fields. 'rate' = entry limiter with a fake ms clock. 'encode' / 'controlEncode' = the text Relay writes on the device (Android libcore org.json: insertion order, '/' escaped); the JVM test compares structure because Maven org.json orders and escapes differently. 'csharpOnly' cases follow libcore where Maven org.json differs.",
